<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dataverse on MarkJacobsen.net</title><link>https://markjacobsen.net/tags/dataverse/</link><description>Recent content in Dataverse on MarkJacobsen.net</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:39:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://markjacobsen.net/tags/dataverse/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to find D365 System Administrators</title><link>https://markjacobsen.net/2026/07/how-to-find-d365-system-administrators/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 14:39:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://markjacobsen.net/2026/07/how-to-find-d365-system-administrators/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The Dynamics 365 System Administrator Role has to be granted individually to Users or given indirectly via a Dataverse Team. Below are a few useful FetchXML queries to help figure out who has the Role and what Dataverse Teams grant the role.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="which-teams-grant-system-admin"&gt;Which Team(s) Grant System Admin?&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note that if an azureactivedirectoryobjectid is returned you would need to perform a separate MS Graph lookup to get the Entra group name. Alternately, you can open the Team in PPAC and it will do the resolution for you.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;fetch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;distinct=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;true&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;count=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;500&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;team&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamtype&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;businessunitid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;azureactivedirectoryobjectid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;emailaddress&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;description&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;order&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;attribute=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamroles&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;link-type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;inner&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;role&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;roleid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;roleid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;link-type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;inner&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;filter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;condition&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;attribute=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;operator=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;eq&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;value=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;System Administrator&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/filter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/link-entity&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/link-entity&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/entity&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/fetch&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="what-users-have-system-admin"&gt;What User(s) have System Admin?&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you want to get a listing of all the Users that have the System Administrator Role granted either directly or indirectly via a Team, you can run this FetchXML. Note that just gives you a list of users with the Role. If you want to see if the Role is granted directly or via a Team you will need to see the queries below this one.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 1&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 2&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 3&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 4&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 5&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 6&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 7&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 8&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt; 9&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;10&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;11&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;12&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;13&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;14&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;15&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;16&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;17&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;18&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;19&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;20&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;21&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;22&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;23&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;24&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;25&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;26&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;27&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;28&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;29&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;30&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;31&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;32&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-xml" data-lang="xml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;fetch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;distinct=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;true&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;count=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;500&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuser&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;fullname&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;internalemailaddress&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;domainname&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;attribute&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;isdisabled&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;order&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;attribute=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;fullname&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;filter&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;or&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;condition&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;entityname=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;direct&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;attribute=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;operator=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;not-null&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;condition&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;entityname=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;team_member&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;attribute=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;operator=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;not-null&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/filter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {/* Direct role assignment */}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserroles&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;link-type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;outer&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;alias=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;direct&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;role&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;roleid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;roleid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;link-type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;inner&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;filter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;condition&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;attribute=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;operator=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;eq&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;value=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;System Administrator&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/filter&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/link-entity&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;/link-entity&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; {/* Role via team membership */}&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teammembership&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;systemuserid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;link-type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;outer&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;alias=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;team_member&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamroles&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;teamid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;link-type=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;inner&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;/&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nt"&gt;&amp;lt;link-entity&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;name=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;role&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;from=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;#34;roleid&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="na"&gt;to=&lt;/spa